    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p>The trumpet archon blows mightily on their horn, creating a tone of such beauty and grandeur those who hear it are paralyzed in awe. Non-archons within 100 feet must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:34] save.</p>\n<p>They are temporarily immune for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is Off-Guard.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Stunned 1 and off-guard as long as it's stunned.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Paralyzed for 1 round.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Trumpet Blast",
