    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>Once per day, if an archon sees another creature cast Translocate, the archon can use dimension door (heightened to 5th level) within 1 round to attempt to follow that creature to the maximum distance of the archon's dimension door.</p>\n<p>If the archon's dimension door has enough distance, the archon appears the same distance and direction from the creature as before either creature used dimension door.</p>",
